{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35155","headline":"诗品二十四则 含蓄 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 含蓄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不着一字，尽得风流。\n语不涉难，已不堪忧。\n是有真宰，与之沈浮。\n如渌满酒，花时返秋。\n悠悠空尘，忽忽海沤。\n浅深聚散，万取一收。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}